cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "OpenAlex Corpus Harvester"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "jongsu-king"
    website: "https://github.com/jongsu-king"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jongsu-king/openalex-corpus-harvester"
abstract: >-
  A Python CLI for collecting OpenAlex records and extracting scientific PDFs
  into Markdown, structured data, and a local SQLite corpus. It retains raw
  responses and PDFs alongside parser output, checksums, and validation
  results for auditability.
keywords:
  - openalex
  - bibliometrics
  - scholarly-metadata
  - corpus
  - pdf-extraction
  - grobid
version: 0.1.0
